, 28, 29)">In healthy amounts, prostaglandins help the uterus shed its lining during your period. When levels spike, cramps become more intense and painful.</span><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>3. Micronutrient Gaps</strong><br><span style="color: rgb(29, 28, 29)">Your body needs nutrients like magnesium, calcium, zinc and vitamin D to stay balanced. Without enough, cramps can hit </span><a href="http://harder.How"><span style="color: rgb(29, 28, 29)">harder.</span></a></p><p><br></p><p><a href="http://harder.How"><strong>How</strong></a><strong> does monthlies help?</strong></p><p><span style="color: rgb(29, 28, 29)">Painkillers only mask cramps once they’ve started. </span>. monthlies strengthens your foundation by addressing the root causes of <em>The Pain Triangle</em>, supporting a healthier cycle from within.</p><p><br></p><p>90% of women reported improvement in period pain and cramps after just 60 days using monthlies**.<br></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="aaf25a0b-ddbc-478f-ae90-5c852cd9dc7f" class="r-1cw2s0y" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="e51ed8b0-2cef-4d6a-af92-44a6ba6506eb" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Radob2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-taayzo"><div data-rid="4ace8131-e988-4e74-bf80-2d5ffc918c94" class="r-alzafp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How do I take it?</p></span></div><div data-rid="dd6c3323-e924-420b-a547-abf122b47c95" class="r-o86dnx"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Radob2:"><div data-rid="9e9dcaab-ec33-43e6-a31