ience the benefits, get your money back - no questions asked.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="29c418d6-ff56-42e2-a257-f6b9a92640df" class="r-529osy" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="01dfb269-9f40-4747-9713-f8c4491a3a26" class="r-x1od4a" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="f812bd84-0a9d-4178-8dcf-f6140398cd0f" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R1tob2:" class="r-1ywug6f"><div data-rid="c43efb2a-0f63-417b-9140-816ffd6328ae" class="r-1986eq0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What is The Pain Triangle? How does monthlies&nbsp;act on it?</p></span></div><div data-rid="e980362f-e491-4d02-8d97-c86670e96cb2" class="r-qa4561"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R1tob2:"><div data-rid="e014a36a-df13-42e9-a9c9-443849d3dfde" class="r-pployk"><div data-rid="528f9ba6-6118-4565-ac0a-c9ea71d50066" class="r-1hnfhlu alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>The Pain Triangle: 3 Causes of Period Cramps</strong></p><ol><li><p><br></p></li></ol><p><strong>1. Hormonal Imbalance</strong></p><p><span style="color: rgb(29, 28, 29)">Too much estrogen hormone raises prostaglandin levels - the “cramp messengers” that tell your uterus to contract.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong>2. Excess Prostaglandins (Cramp Messengers)</strong><br><span style="color: rgb(29, 28, 29)">In healthy amounts, prostaglandins help the uterus shed its lining during your period. When levels spike, cramps become more intense and painful.</span><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>3. Micronutrient Gaps</strong><br><span style="color: rgb(29, 28, 29)">Your body needs nutrients like magnesium, calcium, zinc and vitamin D to stay balanced. Without enough, cramps can hit </span><a href="http://harder.How"><span style="color: rgb(29, 28, 29)">harder.</span></a></p><p><br></p><p><a href="http://harder.How"><strong>How</strong></a><strong> does monthlies help?</strong></p><p><span style="color: rgb(29, 28, 29)">Painkillers only mask cramps once they’ve started. </span>. monthlies strengthens your foundation by addressing the root causes of <em>The Pain Triangle</em>, supporting a healthier cycle from within.</p><br><p>90% of women reported improvement in period pain and cramps after just 60 days using monthlies**.<br></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="117bdbd4-a984-414a-9b0f-eb6983ccd764" class="r-13e364x" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="7cb310c5-8285-4c3d-8d79-7250e1506349" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R2tob2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1nfq0ie"><div data-rid="ea609f5a-61f4-4a22-9ab5-a9a6aed13819" class="r-3cl9ba alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How do I take it?</p></span></div><div data-rid="a4a5e18e-d70a-458f-81c4-10cd79cd4bf8" class="r-u9ay6q"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R2tob2:"><div data-rid="e2cb1a57-dd34-4b76-95af-a477cbcd32e7" class="r-14ldkyg"><div data-rid="89e29942-86bf-48f2-829a-7ddcf172de33" class="r-1055g25 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Taking monthlies is simple and convenient. Add one scoop (7.4 grams) to 300 ml of water or your favourite beverage once a day.</p><p><br></p><p>For optimal results, we recommend taking it in the morning, ideally with food, as it can provide a gentle energy boost that supports you through your day.</p><p><br></p><p>Taking it daily can help build nutrient reserves in the body and deliver the best benefits across your cycle.<br></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="31584cbd-15a5-489e-89b5-aee83f837f71" class="r-1xp6q3o" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="0614d55a-ff64-4a7b-94a2-ed0f2a79f326" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3tob2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-es1ov5"><div data-rid="57da7876-ac61-46dd-ae56-92dd0b39753b" class="r-1apwk0s alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What makes monthlies different?</p></span></div><div data-rid="280fc507-b458-409d-bb51-3c4599066fac" class="r-ftyw9z"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3tob2:"><div data-rid="0b319d9a-a6e1-404a-92c8-baf9a376a30f" class="r-epyib4"><div data-rid="143baa24-fa29-4784-b529-60435fb55e9a" class="r-18ve6kg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Women of reproductive age often need a range of essential nutrients to maintain hormonal balance and general wellness, yet clinical data shows that many adult women are deficient in key nutrients like Folate, Choline, Vitamin D and Iron. monthlies not only helps replenish these critical nutrients but also includes a blend of clinically backed ingredients in highly absorbable forms.</p><p><br></p><ul><li><p><strong>All you need:</strong> 26+ ingredients combined in 1 scoop per day, so no need to invest in multiple supplements for the same benefits.</p></li><li><p><strong>Highly absorbable ingredients: </strong>monthlies offers vitamins like Folate, B6 and B12 in their active (methylated) forms for superior absorption and quality.</p></li><li><p><strong>Superior sourcing:</strong> We have partnered with UK labs that have transparent and trusted sourcing.</p></li></ul><p><strong>CGMP Certified: </strong>We only work with CGMP certified suppliers and manufacturers.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4bbe7bfa-701a-4f43-bbd7-4e7eab5894bc" class="r-ps9omo" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c9348edc-af8a-46c4-8512-e0a8257bed6d" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R4tob2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-kw1e7a"><div data-rid="e557f8bd-25d2-4bc8-8a96-faab29ceaa5f" class="r-zt8uhh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How does the formula work?</p></span></div><div data-rid="f97fa743-c614-4229-8c76-614d39c3b0ba" class="r-nodpck"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R4tob2:"><div data-rid="8b52b625-b585-4510-a3fc-69bc0129e70d" class="r-79jmsw"><div data-rid="beb554b3-414b-4365-8fc2-f7f16a5236d3" class="r-evmopc alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>monthlies works from within, replenishing essential nutrients with highly absorbable ingredients so your body can use them to the fullest. <br><br>It includes <strong>key vitamins, nutrients and plant extracts that support natural processes to tackle inflammation, optimise hormone metabolism, and promote efficient hormone elimination.*</strong></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="9c25ffbc-d26e-4ed3-81eb-dd1843f1c80b" class="r-diqlxw" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="225d053c-cfb8-4970-96f7-aef637ce9321" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5tob2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-12627qc"><div data-rid="dd9264a4-f9fb-4a90-8732-a7b00ab1ea06" class="r-1swwkaw alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Benefits</p></span></div><div data-rid="401b8796-8cbd-415b-bbd0-8a139ffe7d77" class="r-oqfmty"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5tob2:"><div data-rid="487db6d2-b301-473f-b65c-275b422c80c3" class="r-1xcqycj"><div data-rid="8b00d6d4-5ee3-47ed-a847-a07d58ad7f14" class="r-nlra9u alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We recognise that the menstrual cycle affects much more than just period pain. It influences everything from sleep and digestion to mood, energy and skin. That's why we created a product that not only helps with menstrual symptoms but also supports your body's natural processes, reduced period discomfort, and enhances overall health. <br><br>Here are some key benefits:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Hormone Support:</strong> Vitamin B</p></li><li><p><strong>Energy Production:</strong> Magnesium, Vitamin B</p></li><li><p><strong>Mood:</strong> Lemon Balm, Vitamin B6</p></li><li><p><strong>Digestion:</strong> Aniseed</p></li><li><p><strong>Sleep:</strong> Lemon Balm</p></li><li><p><strong>Blood Sugar Support:</strong> Chromium</p></li><li><p><strong>Skin, Hair and Nails</strong>: Vitamin A, B, C, Biotin and Zinc</p></li><li><p><strong>Immune Health:</strong> Vitamin A, C, Selenium and Zinc</p></li></ul></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="50777c01-8e48-4cc0-a3c0-9e855e8c93e9" class="r-cwq4bu" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="f7c58ba6-c389-4f74-b72f-5b665a360a37" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R6tob2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-ogkquk"><div data-rid="a0c9e16d-38c2-4ba6-8729-6a63697f9861" class="r-q7d2zn alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Ingredients</p></span></div><div data-rid="401ca7a4-952b-4d28-85b4-769872e889f2" class="r-szgga2"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R6tob2:"><div data-rid="3003d9a4-e4e7-4f28-aee2-e271fd8a6f3f" class="r-a6won"><div data-rid="882f04a1-5519-4ea0-baac-b9d37255d908" class="r-1vkcxck alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>You can find our full ingredients list <a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow noreferrer" href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0708/7462/8371/files/Ingredients_EN.png?v=1739437663"><u>here</u></a>.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="63519d85-0765-48c0-a377-408cb4b3d3cb" class="r-1csre2k" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="7033b14a-e306-442d-8d00-5ad59058befc" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7tob2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-fq7hkh"><div data-rid="27285f99-3344-4405-ab0f-f72fe329543f" class="r-wol99a alchemy-